## ✅ CORRECT PATTERNS

### RGV Patterns (see `@01_Guidance.mdc §1-2` for full definition)
```
✅ RE-READ relevant XML files fresh BEFORE generating each section
✅ INVENTORY: Count elements, COMMIT to N before generating
✅ GENERATE: Produce exactly N items
✅ VERIFY: Count generated items = N before proceeding
✅ FIX: If mismatch → RE-READ, find missing, fix
✅ CHECKPOINT: Emit micro-checkpoint with N/N counts
```

### Extraction Patterns
```
✅ Read EACH XML file using Read tool
✅ Phase 0: Read ALL files for classification + build reading plan with counts
✅ Phase 1: Per-process RGV loop for Section 3.x
✅ Phase 2: Per-map RGV loop with grouped reads for Section 4.x
✅ Phase 3: Per-profile/function RGV loop for supporting docs
✅ Phase 4: Per-connector/operation/crossref RGV loop for Section 5
✅ Phase 5: RE-READ every XML file for verification
✅ Extract EVERY attribute (position, cacheEnabled, mode, allowSimultaneous)
✅ Document ALL profile fields (mapped AND unmapped)
✅ Include COMPLETE script/Groovy code
✅ Extract ALL cross-reference row data
✅ Document every mapping row individually
```

### Output Patterns
```
✅ Verification counts ONLY in verification-checklist.md
✅ ALL mapping rows in main document Field Mappings table
✅ ALL shape steps in main document Step-by-Step table
✅ Detailed configs in supporting-docs/shape-configuration.md
✅ Reference format: > **📄 Details:** See [`supporting-docs/...`](supporting-docs/...)
```

### Workflow Patterns
```
✅ "Here's the input folder. Please confirm to proceed."
✅ [Wait for single confirmation]
✅ Process all 6 phases continuously
✅ Micro-checkpoint after every section (e.g., ✅ 4.1: MapName — 22/22 mappings)
✅ Phase checkpoint between phases (no waiting)
✅ Present final summary with file list and micro-checkpoint rollup
```

