## ReAct SELF-CHECK (Run EVERY Time Before Generating Output)

### RGV Self-Check
```
□ Did I RE-READ the relevant XML file(s) JUST NOW before generating this section?
  → NO: STOP. RE-READ the file(s) using Read tool before generating.

□ Did I count elements in the XML BEFORE generating (INVENTORY step)?
  → NO: STOP. Count elements first, COMMIT to the number N.

□ Did I COMMIT to count N before generating?
  → NO: STOP. State: "This {component} has N {elements}. I will generate exactly N rows."

□ Does my generated item count = N (VERIFY step)?
  → NO: STOP. RE-READ XML, find missing items, fix before proceeding.

□ Am I generating from stale Phase 0 memory instead of a fresh read?
  → YES: STOP. RE-READ the XML now. Phase 0 reads are for classification only.
```

### Mapping Self-Check
```
□ For mapping tables: Did I read map XML AND source profile AND target profile together?
  → NO: STOP. Read all related files as a group before generating Field Mappings.

□ Am I summarizing or abbreviating mapping tables?
  → YES: STOP. Document every row individually.
```

### Output Self-Check
```
□ Am I placing verification counts in main document?
  → YES: STOP. Move to verification-checklist.md.

□ Am I summarizing shape steps?
  → YES: STOP. Document every shape with full Action.

□ Am I using Read tool (not scripts) for XML?
  → NO: STOP. Switch to Read tool.

□ Am I extracting ALL attributes (position, cache, mode)?
  → NO: STOP. Re-read XML for missing attributes.

□ Am I documenting only mapped profile fields?
  → YES: STOP. Include ALL fields.
```

### Phase Boundary Self-Check
```
□ Am I generating profile/function docs in Phase 2?
  → YES: STOP. Profile/function docs belong in Phase 3.

□ Am I generating connector docs in Phase 2?
  → YES: STOP. Connector docs belong in Phase 4.

□ Am I asking user to continue between phases?
  → YES: STOP. Remove question, proceed automatically.

□ Did I emit a micro-checkpoint with N/N counts after this section?
  → NO: STOP. Emit checkpoint before moving to next section.

□ Did I UPDATE .boomi-state.json after completing this phase?
  → NO: STOP. Update state file with current_phase, phase status, and micro-checkpoints.

□ Did I produce a <thinking> block before this section?
  → NO: STOP. Produce one now.

□ Did I mark assumptions with ⚠️ ASSUMPTION?
  → NO: STOP. Mark now.
```

