## USER RESPONSE HANDLING

| Response | Action |
|----------|--------|
| "proceed" / "yes" / "go" | Start Phase 0, process all 6 phases continuously |
| "wrong folder" / correction | Update input path, re-confirm |
| "stop" / "pause" | Save state to .boomi-state.json, present resume instructions |
| "resume" | Read .boomi-state.json, continue from last phase |

